    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: left">&#160;</td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: right">1,152,742</td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: left">&#160;</td></tr>
