for the years ended December 31, 2022 and 2021 were RMB <span id="xdx_900_eifrs-full--AmortisationExpense_pn3n3_c20220101__20221231__ifrs-full--CarryingAmountAccumulatedDepreciationAmortisationAndImpairmentAndGrossCarryingAmountAxis__custom--SoftwareLicenseMember_z0Zefb4GXIvj"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:AmortisationExpense" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_SoftwareLicenseMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="CNY">1,000</ix:nonFraction>
</span></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">and RMB <span id="xdx_902_eifrs-full--AmortisationExpense_dxL_c20210101__20211231__ifrs-full--CarryingAmountAccumulatedDepreciationAmortisationAndImpairmentAndGrossCarryingAmountAxis__custom--SoftwareLicenseMember_z5ND62g7Bbu3">nil</span></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">.</span></p>

