<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
of December 31, 2022, the fair value of unlisted securities in three accounts owned by the Company held in Ping An Bank Co., Limited
(&#8220;Ping An Bank&#8221;) amounted to RMB <span id="xdx_909_eifrs-full--FinancialAssetsAvailableforsale_iI_c20221231_zUhh2ZcfJvEf" title="Fair value of unlisted securities"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:FinancialAssetsAvailableforsale" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="CNY">8,523,000</ix:nonFraction></span> is determined based on the valuation determined by Ping An Bank using inputs that
are not observable in active market.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">During
the year ended December 31, 2022, fair value unrealized gain of unlisted financial assets was RMB <span id="xdx_900_eifrs-full--FinancialAssetsAtFairValue_iI_c20221231_z06znH4qjlej"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:FinancialAssetsAtFairValue" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="CNY">130,000</ix:nonFraction></span></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

