<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
of December 31, 2022, total other receivables and prepayments of discontinued operations was RMB <span id="xdx_909_eifrs-full--CurrentPrepaymentsAndOtherCurrentAssets_iI_uCNY_c20221231__ifrs-full--ContinuingAndDiscontinuedOperationsAxis__ifrs-full--DiscontinuedOperationsMember_zT3BdCE4T0Xi"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:CurrentPrepaymentsAndOtherCurrentAssets" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31_ifrs-full_DiscontinuedOperationsMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="CNY">3,000,000</ix:nonFraction>
</span></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(Note 29).</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">All
of the other receivables and prepayments are expected to be recovered or recognized as expense within one year. The net carrying value
of these balances is considered a reasonable approximation of fair value. Prepaid expense mainly consisted of advance payment to the
vendors as of December 31, 2022.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

