</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AA_zGbiHMGvczQe" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
of December 31, 2022, total accrued liabilities and other payables of discontinued operations was RMB <span id="xdx_90E_eifrs-full--CurrentAccruedExpensesAndOtherCurrentLiabilities_iI_uCNY_c20221231__ifrs-full--ContinuingAndDiscontinuedOperationsAxis__ifrs-full--DiscontinuedOperationsMember_za6fRuBYiDpf"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:CurrentAccruedExpensesAndOtherCurrentLiabilities" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31_ifrs-full_DiscontinuedOperationsMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="CNY">19,197,000</ix:nonFraction>
</span></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(Note 29).</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Deposits
received represent deposits from the Company&#8217;s distributors. The Company usually requests a deposit from RMB <span id="xdx_904_ecustom--DepositsReceivedFromDistributors_iI_uCNY_c20221231__ifrs-full--RangeAxis__ifrs-full--BottomOfRangeMember_zLX7fuCnCd02" title="Deposits received from distributors"><ix:nonFraction name="aehl:DepositsReceivedFromDistributors" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31_ifrs-full_BottomOfRangeMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="CNY">400,000</ix:nonFraction></span> to RMB <span id="xdx_908_ecustom--DepositsReceivedFromDistributors_iI_uCNY_c20221231__ifrs-full--RangeAxis__ifrs-full--TopOfRangeMember_z9ZDH5ue2bod" title="Deposits received from distributors"><ix:nonFraction name="aehl:DepositsReceivedFromDistributors" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31_ifrs-full_TopOfRangeMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="CNY">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
from new distributors upon signing a distributorship agreement as security for the performance of their obligations under the distributorship
agreement.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Accrued
liabilities consist mainly of accrued rental, wages and utility expenses. Others consist mainly of advance from third-party individuals
and companies, which bear no interest and payable upon demand.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
carrying value of accrued liabilities and other payables is considered to be a reasonable approximation of fair value.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"></p>

