    date (investors and placement agent, respectively)</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; padding-bottom: 1.5pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></td>
    <td colspan="2" style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span id="xdx_902_eifrs-full--DateOfGrantOfSharebasedPaymentArrangement_c20200525__20200527_zAgVrvaX2iNf" title="Grant date"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2020-05-252020-05-27" name="ifrs-full:DateOfGrantOfSharebasedPaymentArrangement">May
    27 and May 25, 2020</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; padding-bottom: 1.5pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></td></tr>
